---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service & Editorial Disclaimer | Jabalpuriya.com"
  description="Terms of service, content attribution, and editorial disclaimer for Jabalpuriya.com."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0c1c33] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-jabalpur-secondary/10 text-jabalpur-secondary border border-jabalpur-secondary/20">
          Legal Agreement
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          Terms of Service & Disclaimer
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Effective Date: October 1, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Terms Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using <strong>Jabalpuriya.com</strong>, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of the website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Editorial Integrity & News Aggregation</h2>
          <p>
            Jabalpuriya.com is an independent news aggregation, community, and cultural portal focused on Jabalpur and surrounding districts in Madhya Pradesh. We aggregate headlines from verified media publishers, news agencies, and government portals with full source attribution and direct hyperlinks to original sources.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Intellectual Property & Fair Use</h2>
          <p>
            All original content, branding, design elements, and astrological predictions published on Jabalpuriya.com are the property of Jabalpuriya.com. News article excerpts and thumbnails sourced from third-party publishers remain the intellectual property of their respective copyright holders and are displayed under fair use for informative journalism purposes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Disclaimer of Warranties & Helplines</h2>
          <p>
            While we make every effort to verify civic information, railway/bus timings, and emergency helplines, all content is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India, under the jurisdiction of the courts of Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-jabalpur-primary text-white hover:bg-jabalpur-secondary transition-all shadow-md">
          ← Back to Jabalpuriya Home
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
